<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Jan manufacturing sales rise four pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Jan manufacturing sales rise four pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch January manufacturing sales were some four percent higher than in the same month of 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>The CBS manufacturing sales figures refer to the guilder value of manufacturers' sales. Production figures, showing the rise or fall in volume terms, are published separately.</p>
<p>The CBS said it now planned to publish January manufacturing production figures along with February figures in mid-April.  </p>
<p>DUTCH MANUFACTURING SALES</p>
<p>			  (pct change in guilders yr/yr)</p>
<p>			Domestic	 Export	  Total</p>
<p> January 97		  6		3		4</p>
<p> December 96		 8		6		7</p>
<p> Year 96		     5		2		4</p>
<p> Q4 96			 8		5		6</p>
<p> Q3 96			 6		4		5</p>
